{
  "assessment": "As the newly established Head of Government of Venezuela, our immediate priority is to stabilise the hyperinflationary environment while maintaining internal cohesion across all societal strata, particularly the military and urban workers. Inflation remains dangerously high at 254.9%, requiring a tightening of monetary policy. Concurrently, given the moderate threat assessment regarding hostile actions from the United States and territorial friction with Guyana, we must modestly bolster our defensive posture without straining the budget. We shall pursue diplomatic outreach to traditional allies and maintain social stability through targeted welfare and controlled media.",
