      "text": "The Government of Venezuela proposes closer strategic and economic cooperation, including formal alliance talks, to counter external pressures."
    }
  ],
  "public_statement": "The Bolivarian Republic of Venezuela stands firm against foreign coercion. We are implementing decisive economic reforms to conquer inflation, safeguard national prosperity, and protect our sovereignty against imperialist threats.",
